  "summary": "Reviewed issue 73 stable playback Snap implementation, including dedicated clock control authority, shared canvas/inspector validation, captured-grid ruler/entry semantics, diagnostics and preservation of accepted timing through compatible manual target/render updates. Guide explains fixed-tempo offsets and real drift without tempo-map claims. Existing controls, assets, screenshots and audio admission remain unchanged; native tests cover missing wet and disabled output.",
